+## Memory Tool
+
+### Basic Usage
+
+```python
+import anthropic
+
+client = anthropic.Anthropic()
+
+response = client.messages.create(
+    model="{{OPUS_ID}}",
+    max_tokens=16000,
+    messages=[{"role": "user", "content": "Remember that my preferred language is Python."}],
