+
+| Friendly Name     | Alias (use this)    | Full ID                       | Status |
+|-------------------|---------------------|-------------------------------|--------|
+| Claude Opus 4.5   | `claude-opus-4-5`   | `claude-opus-4-5-20251101`    | Active |
